        <briefdescription>
<para>Builds and returns cell-based connectivity data without storing it. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Launches a parallel kernel that, for every cell, iterates over its face stencil and records the neighbour cell, the face sign, and the matrix column index for each face.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>SparsityType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Sparsity pattern type (e.g. <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1CsrSparsityPattern" kindref="compound">CsrSparsityPattern</ref>, <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1la_1_1CooSparsityPattern" kindref="compound">CooSparsityPattern</ref>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
