    <briefdescription>
<para>Iteration strategy that traverses cells and their face stencils. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pre-computes a cell-centric connectivity table (<ref refid="structNeoN_1_1la_1_1CellBasedIterator_1_1CellBasedData" kindref="compound">CellBasedData</ref>) so that each cell can independently gather all face contributions during assembly, which is better suited for GPU-parallel execution than the face-based approach. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
